        "tab_materials": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Materials & craft",
            "icon": "leather",
            "content": "<p>Every EvlveX is cut, stitched and finished by hand from full-grain leathers and suedes chosen to age well. The materials of this model are described above; each pair's maker and finishing date are recorded on its certificate.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_fit": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Size & fit",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "content": "<p>EU sizing. Most models are true to size; if you are between sizes, we recommend the larger size. Hand-sewn loafers soften to the foot within a week of wear.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_care": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Care",
            "icon": "washing",
            "content": "<p>Smooth leather: wipe with a soft, dry cloth and feed with neutral cream every few months. Suede: brush gently in one direction and protect before first wear. Woven leather: dust with a soft brush, never soak. Store in the dust bag with cedar shoe trees. <a href=\"/pages/care\" title=\"Care guide\">Full care guide</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & returns",
            "icon": "truck",
            "content": "<p>Complimentary shipping on every order. Returns accepted within 14 days in original, unworn condition with the certificate tag and workshop card in the box.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_certificate": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Your pair's certificate",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Every pair is numbered, signed by the artisan who finished it, and carries a QR tag under the tongue. When your order ships, its certificate is registered in your name: scan the tag to read the story of your pair. <a href=\"/pages/authenticity\" title=\"Authenticity\">How it works</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
